core-terminal (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Make the bottom Settings Save action authoritative for Window Groups.
  * Add, remove, edit, and reorder every tab in a saved Window Group.
  * Protect profiles referenced by groups and validate saved directories.
  * Preserve the host login shell and desktop session environment in Flatpak.
  * Remove Flatpak development files and expand release checks.

